# AstroPrecise — Cloudflare Pages response headers (deployed with the static site).
# ⚠ INERT ON GITHUB PAGES (the current host — Server: GitHub.com ignores _headers).
# Nothing user-facing may promise a CSP while we're on GitHub Pages; this file
# becomes live only after a move to Cloudflare Pages. Note also: the AI panel
# accepts a free-text BYOK endpoint, so if this CSP ever goes live its
# connect-src allowlist (api.openai.com / openrouter.ai) will silently block
# custom endpoints — widen or document at migration time.
# CSP connect-src mirrors fetch() targets in js/fieldweather.js, js/instrument.js,
# js/app.js (geocoding), js/chart-page.js (weather), and AP_MON email/checkout endpoints.
# script-src: 'self' only (no unsafe-eval). Inline boot snippets need 'unsafe-inline'
# until migrated to external .js; PayPal = checkout provider (2026-07-02, link-out to PayPal-hosted pages; SDK host kept for the dormant on-site path — do NOT enable on GitHub Pages).
# See also: tools/setup-cloudflare-cache.mjs

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.paypal.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://list.astroprecise.app https://services.swpc.noaa.gov https://qrng.anu.edu.au https://geocoding-api.open-meteo.com https://api.open-meteo.com https://api.openai.com https://openrouter.ai https://api.gumroad.com; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; form-action 'self' https://list.astroprecise.app; frame-src 'self' https://www.paypal.com https://form.typeform.com